{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eik6rMNyO11792849823.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>匹克球亞巡賽香港大滿貫，「一哥」約翰斯與「一姐」華特絲在混雙打入決賽。</p><p></p><p>只角逐雙打的約翰斯，除了在男雙打入決賽，在混雙亦未逢敵手。</p><p></p><p>面向鏡頭的「世一」組合，四強對中華台北及美國組合，一開始就壓著對手，首局「派蛋」大勝11-0。他們相隔半年重返亞洲賽場，更是首度來港出戰。</p><p></p><p>第二局繼續強勢，只讓對手拿到1分，他們再贏11-1，以「超班」姿勢晉級決賽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:16.334708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:26.030474+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:36:53.137681+00:00","content_hash":"2462730bce360c9b2ee251a5ca4cffb96fd58fb9f8ab6788244215c3396ab888","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}